      en: ["The cathedral is the episcopal seat of the Roman Catholic Diocese of Goma.", "It famously survived the major eruption of Mount Nyiragongo in 2002.", "Lava flows reached the edge of the cathedral grounds but did not destroy it.", "The church serves as a sanctuary and aid center during times of crisis.", "It is one of the most significant architectural structures in the city of Goma.", "The cathedral supports various local schools and social development projects."],
